{"h":3395,"w":2400,"lines":[{"x":0.86213991771033005,"w":0.061728394826253252,"c":1,"h":0.014723203769140158,"y":0.060954063473792952,"t":"Test 6"},{"w":0.045267489751180015,"y":0.110465116162203,"t":"BETH:","x":0.082304526626467603,"c":1,"h":0.010174418787512574},{"y":0.12499999987022969,"t":"JAMES:","c":1,"w":0.053497943878173818,"x":0.082304525895946182,"h":0.011627907185728703},{"x":0.084362139567236066,"t":"ВЕТH:","c":1,"w":0.043209877014160153,"h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.14098837198900427},{"h":0.010174418787512574,"w":0.055555553436279284,"y":0.20203488360915067,"c":1,"x":0.080246914545234846,"t":"JAMES:"},{"h":0.010174418787512574,"y":0.21802325569574799,"t":"BЕTH:","x":0.082304526410615392,"c":1,"w":0.043209877014160153},{"h":0.008720930389296444,"w":0.051440327962239574,"y":0.24854651152971752,"t":"JAMES:","c":1,"x":0.082304527269347838},{"x":0.082276823761329013,"y":0.26446588882085842,"w":0.043265282313028966,"h":0.0088589199861451862,"c":1,"t":"ВЕТH:"},{"x":0.082304527274024222,"w":0.051440327962239588,"h":0.010174418787512463,"c":1,"t":"JAMES:","y":0.29505813942133474},{"w":0.041152264277140305,"x":0.082304526194763195,"t":"BETH:","h":0.0087209303892965551,"y":0.31104651152773544,"c":1},{"y":0.32547519701332717,"t":"JAMES:","x":0.080199200194281992,"h":0.011840303598500412,"c":1,"w":0.051535755793253576},{"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1,"y":0.34156976732499378,"x":0.080246913236747069,"t":"BЕTH:","w":0.043209877014160153},{"w":0.051516176859537743,"h":0.011796443566276293,"x":0.080208989769437466,"c":1,"t":"JAMES:","y":0.35602038280985204},{"x":0.082304526194763195,"h":0.008720930389296444,"t":"ВЕТH:","y":0.37209302315564252,"w":0.041152264277140305,"c":1},{"t":"JAMES:","h":0.0092222648458851753,"c":1,"y":0.44887723964921222,"w":0.051606028874715174,"x":0.080164063644783776},{"t":"OK. Now how are you finding the courses you're taking this term, James?","x":0.15020577362600021,"w":0.5864197285970052,"y":0.10600706731252019,"h":0.017667844522968212,"c":1},{"h":0.016010628150966877,"x":0.15020576313378964,"y":0.12209302305503589,"t":"Well, I'm really enjoying the one on Swedish cinema.","w":0.42386830647786466,"c":1},{"t":"That'll continue next term, but the one on Scandinavian literature that's running at the Q23","y":0.13808139521615148,"x":0.14814815589443886,"c":1,"w":0.72633743286132812,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"y":0.15253239081003922,"t":"moment will be replaced by more specialised courses. Oh, and by the way, if you're","c":1,"w":0.66460901896158853,"h":0.016195524146054185,"x":0.14814817078669534},{"t":"interested in watching Danish television programmes - there's going to be a course","h":0.018773951715799653,"c":1,"x":0.14806470087375384,"w":0.66477569580078133,"y":0.16646997674794606},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"on that the term after next.","x":0.14814815323702618,"y":0.18459302313107262,"w":0.21604937235514321},{"c":1,"t":"That sounds good.","x":0.15020576128801044,"y":0.20053003553519422,"w":0.15226337432861325,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"w":0.67489710489908861,"h":0.014565699794126696,"c":1,"x":0.15020576842668448,"y":0.21511627893673779,"t":"Have you started thinking about the literature paper that you have to write in the next"},{"y":0.22920601847992617,"t":"few weeks?","w":0.098993968963623058,"h":0.013971683695403359,"c":1,"x":0.14803388045403371},{"t":"Yes, my first choice would be to do something on the Icelandic sagas.","w":0.55555557250976562,"x":0.15020575272243963,"y":0.2455830388139193,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Hmm. The trouble with that is that a lot of people choose that topic, and it can be","h":0.017933606820617731,"x":0.14806196397470803,"y":0.25934714604481157,"w":0.64214558919270837},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"difficult to get hold of the books youll need. Why not leave that for another time?","w":0.63991770426432293,"c":1,"x":0.1481481436497315,"y":0.2776162789368154},{"y":0.29194802932030961,"t":"Right.","h":0.014941150364241151,"x":0.14802972246398308,"w":0.049619566599527987,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"You might find modern novels or 19th century playwrights interesting.","x":0.14609052759854038,"y":0.3052325578626216,"w":0.54938273111979175,"h":0.016027748233718775},{"w":0.037037035624186143,"c":1,"t":"Q24","x":0.83539094711165418,"y":0.30813953472769251,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"w":0.60082305908203126,"y":0.32267441846940703,"x":0.1460905280393886,"t":"I've read or seen several plays in translation. so that would be a good idea.","h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.28806584676106772,"x":0.14814814644179913,"t":"Fine. I'Il put you down for that topic.","y":0.33863368664405125,"h":0.014563987898180808},{"w":0.47530863444010418,"t":"Right. So what would you advise me to aim at in the paper?","x":0.14814815181286964,"c":1,"h":0.01472320376914027,"y":0.35453474699282905},{"t":"First I suggest you avoid taking one writer and going into a great deal of detail. That","x":0.14609054307351149,"h":0.014534883982160851,"y":0.369186046377739,"c":1,"w":0.66872426350911462},{"t":"approach certainly has its place, but Ithink you first need to get an understanding","y":0.38515901084571591,"x":0.14609053678807735,"c":1,"w":0.65432098388671878,"h":0.01455029160732102},{"x":0.83539094711165418,"w":0.037037035624186143,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"y":0.38517441844862277,"t":"Q25"},{"x":0.14609052859265698,"c":1,"t":"of the literature in the context of the society in which it was produced - who it was","y":0.40106007064303029,"h":0.013250883392226243,"w":0.65226338704427089},{"c":1,"t":"written for, how it was published, and so on. I also think that's more fruitful than","h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.41569767428491,"w":0.62962961832682296,"x":0.14609054053492154},{"y":0.43033422035937585,"w":0.32123825073242185,"x":0.14597902431805135,"h":0.016179556560179331,"c":1,"t":"placing it within the history of the genre."},{"t":"OK, that sounds reasonable.","x":0.14803294289786426,"y":0.4460581882917849,"h":0.013298469381703093,"c":1,"w":0.23072296142578128},{"w":0.61111109415690101,"t":"Could I ask for some advice about writing the paper I'm working on about the","y":0.48546511615925281,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"x":0.1481481565202365},{"x":0.1459999708797389,"c":1,"y":0.49948827194171552,"h":0.01671931375743918,"w":0.44256535847981771,"t":"Vikings? I have to do that this week, and I'm a bit stuck."},{"y":0.51590106021073245,"t":"Of course. Have you decided yet what to write about?","w":0.43004114786783854,"x":0.1460905370773822,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1},{"y":0.5319767440530484,"w":0.65226338704427078,"h":0.014548579711374909,"c":1,"x":0.14403291542510877,"t":"No, I haven't. There's so much that seems interesting - Viking settlement in other"},{"c":1,"y":0.54796511613876453,"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"countries, trade, mythology...","w":0.23868311564127606,"x":0.14609054083779818},{"t":"Well, what I suggest is that you read an assignment a student wrote last year, which","x":0.14403291260278014,"w":0.67078191121419273,"c":1,"h":0.016195524146054185,"y":0.56242638383499477},{"c":1,"y":0.57848837196015102,"t":"is kept in the library. It's short and well focused, and I'm sure youll find it helpful. Ill","h":0.014562276002234698,"x":0.14403293081285767,"w":0.66255142211914064},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"x":0.14403291356978362,"y":0.59302325566707903,"c":1,"t":"give you the details in a moment. Textbooks usually cover so many topics, it can be","w":0.66460906982421875},{"w":0.25748435974121092,"y":0.6078262018471704,"c":1,"h":0.015783943472818418,"t":"very difficult to choose just one.","x":0.14390756036182051},{"x":0.1460175245939945,"w":0.62771438598632812,"h":0.017058053482828517,"t":"OK. I've got a DVD of the film about the Vikings that came out earlier this year.","c":1,"y":0.62260468900179233},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.639534883583327,"x":0.14609053189385815,"c":1,"w":0.2139917755126953,"t":"Should I watch that again?"},{"w":0.62962961832682296,"h":0.014723203769140158,"y":0.65547703168211113,"c":1,"t":"If it's the one I am thinking of, hmm, I'd ignore it - it's more fantasy than reality.","x":0.14403292735574658},{"t":"But I've got a recording of a documentary that you should watch. It makes some","h":0.014570836043610536,"w":0.63580245971679694,"y":0.67005813940027548,"x":0.14609053959904753,"c":1},{"w":0.63786010742187504,"t":"interesting and provocative points, which I think will help you to focus your topic.","h":0.014534883982160851,"c":1,"y":0.68604651149438478,"x":0.14403290912445346},{"x":0.83333333394292997,"t":"Q26","h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.56249999984397159,"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186143},{"t":"Q27","h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"y":0.67151162776828488,"x":0.83333333394292997,"w":0.037037035624186143},{"x":0.078038752102990994,"w":0.04968381245930989,"y":0.71902973424714822,"c":1,"h":0.0096149500744643346,"t":"JAMES:"},{"y":0.73546511617775079,"t":"BETH:","c":1,"x":0.078189300073166837,"w":0.043209877014160167,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"t":"So then should I work out an outline?","y":0.71643109532341742,"w":0.30041152954101563,"h":0.013250883392226132,"x":0.144032918254903,"c":1},{"x":0.14403293363078148,"w":0.6440328979492187,"t":"Yes. Just headings for different sections, at this stage. And then you should start","h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"y":0.73255813940177106},{"y":0.74852767951633681,"t":"looking for suitable articles and books to draw on, and take notes which you organise","w":0.67901234944661459,"x":0.14197530665273747,"h":0.014553715960858749,"c":1},{"x":0.14609052907685055,"t":"according to those headings.","y":0.76295641951661552,"w":0.23251029968261716,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1},{"h":0.011945955885313109,"c":1,"t":"JAMES:","x":0.076060535828138806,"w":0.051582632064819348,"y":0.78036423130675892},{"c":1,"x":0.076131687120294764,"y":0.79651162777341478,"w":0.045267489751180015,"t":"BETH:","h":0.011627907185728592},{"y":0.77875220653573385,"x":0.14335549025334024,"t":"I see.","w":0.050845206578572583,"c":1,"h":0.012348000938676162},{"w":0.65432098388671878,"t":"Then put short phrases and sentences as bullet points under each heading. Make","x":0.14197531042124173,"h":0.014558851648696858,"c":1,"y":0.79358068336330245},{"t":"sure that this skeleton makes sense and flows properly, before writing up the paper","h":0.013250883392226132,"w":0.66460906982421886,"c":1,"x":0.14403291354550712,"y":0.80948174315939192},{"t":"in full.","c":1,"y":0.82558139520284568,"w":0.055555553436279298,"x":0.13991769642106233,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"c":1,"t":"JAMES: OK. Thanks, that's very helpful.","y":0.84010600698169402,"h":0.015998644317698818,"x":0.076131689046480058,"w":0.32098765055338546},{"c":1,"t":"Q28","x":0.83333333394292997,"w":0.037037035624186143,"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.7180232556752616},{"y":0.73255813937645065,"c":1,"w":0.039094651540120484,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"Q29","x":0.83127571940097877},{"t":"Q30","w":0.037037035624186254,"c":1,"x":0.83333333393687814,"y":0.79505813939809178,"h":0.011627907185728703},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"103","x":0.87860082365486392,"y":0.93459302309978554,"w":0.037037035624186143},{"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.39483721299237268,"y":0.96768258536995222,"c":1,"w":0.20824633280436194,"h":0.016454192297478354}]}